    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061228.0347\n\nLONDON, Dec 28 , 2006, 2006\n\nEuropean exchanges close mixed; London down 0.07 percent\n\n\n\n\nEuropean stock exchanges closed mixed on Thursday, with the London FTSE 100 finishing down 0.07 percent at 6,240.90 points.\n\nIn Paris the CAC 40 fell 0.12 percent to finish at 5,533.36, while in Frankfurt the Dax gained 0.04 percent to close at 6,611.81.",
